    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_intro">Please read and accept the privacy notice before using the app.</string>
    <string name="privacy_intro_review">Privacy notice for this app.</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">This app is a private, unofficial information service for party supporters and not an official offering of the AfD or its subdivisions.

DATA COLLECTED
The app only processes data required for its operation and stores it locally on your device only:
• Settings (e.g. language, design, enabled news sources)
• Cached news content
• The privacy status you accepted

NO SHARING WITH THIRD PARTIES
No personal data is transmitted to us or to third parties. There is no user account, no advertising, no tracking and no analytics.

NETWORK ACCESS
When loading news, events and maps, the public content of the linked sources is fetched directly from their servers. As with any website visit, technically necessary connection data (e.g. IP address) is transmitted to the respective providers. Their privacy policies apply.

BANKING APPS
The "Donate with your banking app" feature detects installed banking apps locally on your device only, in order to open them. No data about installed apps is stored or transmitted. Transfer data is never transmitted automatically.

EXTERNAL LINKS
When opening external links you leave the app; the privacy policies of the respective providers apply.

YOUR CONTROL
You can remove all local data at any time via "Settings → Clear cache" or by uninstalling the app.

By tapping "Accept" you confirm that you have read and understood this notice. Consent is stored locally only and can be revoked by clearing the app data.</string>
