    <string name="more_about">About the app</string>
    <string name="more_about_text">Private, unofficial information app for party supporters – not an official product of the AfD or its subdivisions.\n\nThe app bundles news from selected sources, election dates and polls, events on a map, contacts of Bundestag and state parliament members, and the election programme with full-text search. All content is loaded from the linked sources at runtime; there is no user account, no advertising and no tracking.\n\nAll information without guarantee. Rights to content and logos belong to their respective owners.</string>
